on":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":"-0.5","y":"0","z":"0"}],"uuid":"3372bfed-b853-5659-8de6-24d6285555e2","time":0.3,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":"-2.5","y":"0","z":"0"}],"uuid":"fadccdb4-b197-5241-b08d-c04285835d7b","time":0.6,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":"-5","y":"0","z":"0"}],"uuid":"6b4ae753-82c9-52e0-8ac4-e6c625bc2aee","time":0.85,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":"-5","y":"0","z":"0"}],"uuid":"efc4a8cb-a542-53bb-a1cf-a6c9a3032124","time":1,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"},{"channel":"position","data_points":[{"x":"-5","y":"0","z":"0"}],"uuid":"cd1069e7-0739-521f-80a7-746ece18b374","time":1.6,"color":-1,"interpolation":"catmullrom"}]}}}],"description":"# cannon_iron_fixed\n\nFixed iron cannon for the Citadel's engine platform (Patch 5): the remade long, wide-bore iron barrel on a timber cradle with stepped cheeks, knee braces, a quoin under the breech and iron straps; no wheels or axle. It is built from `cannon_iron` and keeps its bones and clips except the wheels; it cannot move.\n\n- Placement: its origin sits on the Citadel's `slot_engine`, facing -Z; its crewmen stand at `slot_crew_1` and `slot_crew_2`.\n- Bounds: x -12..12, y 0..34, z -38..24 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 128, 1 px per unit, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 66.\n\n## Clips\n\n- `idle` (4 s, loop)\n- `fire` (2.4 s)\n- `reload` (3 s)\n- `aim` (3 s, loop)\n- `damaged` (0.7 s)\n- `destroyed` (1.6 s)\n\n(`move` and `move_towed` are removed: a fixed engine never moves.)\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_muzzle` at (0, 26, -38.2)\n- `slot_muzzle` at (0, 26, -38.2)\n- `slot_crew_1` at (16, 0, 28)\n- `slot_crew_2` at (-16, 0, 28)"}